  "$comment": "Authoring source for the htdemucs stem-split processor. The native sidecar (iblis-stems.exe, packages/plugins/demucs-stems/native, MIT) is built and published to GCS by .github/workflows/stems-build.yml and transcribed with `just stems-pack-transcribe`; the Demucs weights are fetched vendor-direct from a revision-pinned Hugging Face URL (never mirrored to GCS). All three Demucs packs share the same binary; only --model and the weights differ. See demucs-stems/UPSTREAM.txt.",
